1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,913
I failed an exam I was sure I
would pass, and came home

2
00:00:03,913 --> 00:00:04,616
deeply sad.

3
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:10,819
My mother saw my face: "My
child, what's wrong?"

4
00:00:10,819 --> 00:00:14,672
When I told her what happened,
she told me a story.

5
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:23,743
Long ago, a king was
travelling to a ceremony with

6
00:00:23,743 --> 00:00:25,077
his faithful servant.

7
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:28,921
His horse stepped into a hole
and fell.

8
00:00:28,921 --> 00:00:31,938
The king was thrown off,
hurting his hand and leg.

9
00:00:32,817 --> 00:00:36,647
But the servant calmly said,
"Everything is for the good."

10
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:40,410
Furious, the king threw the
servant into a pit and rode on

11
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:40,704
alone.

12
00:00:43,358 --> 00:00:46,509
People seeking someone with no
blemish on their body, to

13
00:00:46,509 --> 00:00:48,648
offer as a sacrifice, seized
the king.

14
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:51,799
But they saw his wounds and
let him go.

15
00:00:51,799 --> 00:00:54,318
And the king remembered his
servant's words.

16
00:00:56,358 --> 00:00:59,662
The king went back, pulled the
servant out and told him

17
00:00:59,662 --> 00:01:03,206
everything. The servant said,
"Everything is for the good."

18
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:07,283
"How was throwing you into the
pit good?"

19
00:01:07,283 --> 00:01:11,484
"If I had gone with you, they
would have sacrificed me."

20
00:01:13,308 --> 00:01:16,254
When she finished, my sadness
was gone.

21
00:01:16,254 --> 00:01:19,653
My result hadn't changed, but
my outlook had.

22
00:01:19,653 --> 00:01:21,693
Everything is for the good.
